 l2_swirl_size 400
 addUserKnob {7 l2_turbulence l turbulence t "A finer, second swirl (a third the size) that makes the edges roll and churn; animate 'evolve' to boil it."}
 addUserKnob {7 l2_crumble l crumble t "Bites chunks out of the thin edges, for torn, ragged cloud and fog."}
